---
title: GitHub Release Notifier — Application Architecture
---
flowchart TD
    Client["Client<br/>(REST / gRPC)"]

    subgraph api["API process — src/index.ts"]
        Present["Presentation<br/><small>subscription routes & gRPC handlers</small>"]
        SubSvc["Subscription module<br/><small>SubscriptionService</small>"]
        SagaOrch["Saga module<br/><small>SubscribeSagaOrchestrator</small>"]
        Scanner["Scanner module<br/><small>ScannerService, cron every 10 min</small>"]
        GH["GitHub module<br/><small>HTTP client + caching & metrics decorators</small>"]
    end

    subgraph worker["Notifier worker — src/notifier/index.ts"]
        NotifCons["Notification module<br/><small>NotificationService (consumer)</small>"]
        SagaHandler["Saga command handler"]
        SagaMailGrpc["Saga-mail gRPC server"]
        Mailer["Mailer module<br/><small>MailerService → Nodemailer</small>"]
    end

    subgraph backing["Backing services"]
        PG[("PostgreSQL<br/><small>Drizzle ORM, unit of work</small>")]
        Redis[("Redis<br/><small>GitHub response cache</small>")]
        subgraph mq["RabbitMQ"]
            NotifQ[/"release.notifications<br/><small>+ retry queue + DLQ</small>"/]
            SagaQ[/"saga.subscription.commands & .replies<br/><small>+ DLQs</small>"/]
        end
    end

    GitHubAPI(["GitHub API"])
    SMTP(["Email provider (SMTP)"])

    Client --> Present
    Present -->|subscribe| SagaOrch
    Present -->|confirm / unsubscribe / list| SubSvc

    SubSvc --> PG
    SagaOrch -->|"saga state + subscription<br/>(one transaction)"| PG
    SagaOrch -->|validate repo| GH
    SagaOrch <-->|"command / reply<br/>(queue transport)"| SagaQ
    SagaOrch -.->|"gRPC transport<br/>(configurable alternative)"| SagaMailGrpc

    Scanner -->|read repos, save releases| PG
    Scanner -->|fetch releases| GH
    Scanner -->|publish| NotifQ

    GH --> Redis
    GH --> GitHubAPI

    NotifQ --> NotifCons
    SagaQ <-->|"consume command / publish reply"| SagaHandler

    NotifCons --> Mailer
    SagaHandler --> Mailer
    SagaMailGrpc --> Mailer
    Mailer --> SMTP
